    "content": "Looking for professional party and balloon decorators in Jaipur? Party Square brings you stunning balloon arches, neon backdrops, theme birthday setups, and romantic room decor directly to your doorstep. Our verified decorators in Jaipur ensure quick 2-hour setups, high-grade metallic balloons, and 100% on-time execution for birthdays, anniversaries, baby showers, and festive occasions.",
    "faqs": [
      {
        "question": "How early should I book decoration services in Jaipur?",
        "answer": "We recommend booking at least 24 hours in advance. However, same-day and urgent 3-hour decoration slots are also available across Jaipur based on availability.",
        "_id": "6acf292d3f6608230698c27b"
      },
      {
        "question": "Do decorators in Jaipur bring their own setup materials and ladder?",
        "answer": "Yes, our certified decorators carry all required materials, balloon pumps, ribbons, removable non-marking tape, and setup gear. You don't need to provide anything.",
        "_id": "6acf292d3f6608230698c27c"
      },
      {
        "question": "Can I customize the balloon theme or colors for my event in Jaipur?",
        "answer": "Absolutely! All our packages can be customized with your choice of color palette, personalized neon signs, foil numbers, and bespoke themes.",
        "_id": "6acf292d3f6608230698c27d"
      }
